<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4499"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 22, 2005 - 3:38 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Okay, I&#39;ve wasted a full 30 minutes looking at these freakin word puzzles and here are all the words I found.  To let you know in advance, I found words within words, went up, down, and diagonal, backwards and forwards, side to side.  Those words where the letters were questionable I will put a question mark by.  Here goes.  Maybe there is something there.... <BR> <BR>fib <BR>sex <BR>kid <BR>in <BR>nip <BR>lot <BR>leo <BR>build <BR>builds <BR>top <BR>cruise <BR>plan <BR>details <BR>car <BR>sow <BR>spot <BR>pot <BR>hat <BR>pig &#40;found twice&#41; <BR>rum <BR>PJ <BR>up <BR>pin <BR>prowl <BR>owl <BR>pet <BR>helm <BR>elm <BR>MO <BR>row <BR>wit <BR>oil <BR>fan <BR>steam <BR>team <BR>follow <BR>sat <BR>sims <BR>sim <BR>five?? <BR>fives?? <BR> <BR>sos <BR>yes <BR>boa <BR>toy <BR>office <BR>officer <BR>peg <BR>par <BR>ice <BR>anderson <BR>school <BR>rye <BR>telephone <BR>phone <BR>poet <BR>wichita <BR>pet <BR>red <BR>son <BR>rye <BR>larry <BR>sub?? <BR> <BR>at <BR>fir <BR>shed <BR>he <BR>she <BR>poe &#40;As in Edgar Allen Poe or someone else&#41; <BR>led <BR>ruse <BR>use <BR>dog <BR>sold <BR>set <BR>man <BR>handy <BR>handyman <BR>hand <BR>no <BR>nor <BR>help <BR>stem <BR>met <BR>mets <BR>ice <BR>iceman <BR>insurance <BR>ran <BR>real <BR>God <BR>sold <BR>cad <BR>dam <BR>realtor <BR>sis <BR>lost <BR>dog <BR>lost dog <BR>new <BR>mad <BR>dress <BR>fake <BR>fakeid