<!--Post: 4627--><!--Time: 1106600916-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4627"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Researcher<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Researcher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 24, 2005 - 1:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Iceman?  Ice?  Perhaps related to the BTK poem &#34;Death To Nancy&#34; - about ice cold hands taking a grip on him??????<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4627-->
<!--Post: 5722--><!--Time: 1107303912-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5722"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iq<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iq<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 4:25 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m not convinced the chapter entitled PJs in the BTK chapter list has anything to do with Professor PJ Wyatt. The first time I read the theory it didn&#39;t make sense to me. Why PJs, why not PJ or PJ&#39;s or even PJ,s. <BR> <BR>My belief is that PJs is a military reference. There was a group that started in Viet Nam called PJs &#40;short for parajumpers&#41;. I think BTK has some link to this group.  <BR> <BR>Here is a link, and there are more: <BR><a href="http://www.pjsinnam.com/index.htm" target=_top>http://www.pjsinnam.com/index.htm</a> <BR> <BR>Feedback? <BR> <BR>iq<!--/Text--></td></tr>
